1801,mgtf-sp19,"# Description

Participants will be training regressors to evaluate the Sale Price. Students need to login using ucsd email ids and will need to form teams of size 5 (at max).

You need to provide your user_id in the report you submit on GradeScope along with the names of the rest of your teammates.
----------------------
# Evaluation

Refer to sampleSubmission.csv for the submission file format. 
You will need to provide the ID and the SalePrice in your submission file.
Once you upload your results, you can find your evaluation/rank on the leaderboard. The public board is based on 50% of the results you have uploaded and the private board(which will be displayed once the competition ends) is based on other 50%.


The evaluation metric for this competition is RMSE","# Dataset Description

