**BsmtFinish2Area** : Type 2 finished square feet  
**PoolQuality** : Pool quality  
**OpenPorchArea** : Open porch area in square feet  
**Fireplaces** : number of fireplaces  
**RoofType** : style of the roof  
**Functional** : Home functionality rating  
**ExteriorCond** : Present condition of the material on the exterior  
**GarageCondition** : Garage condition  
**TotalBsmtArea** : Total square feet of basement area  
