**SeasonPorchArea** : Three season porch area in square feet  
**LowQualityFinishArea** : Low quality finished square feet (all floors)  
**ProximityToMainRoad** : Proximity to main road or railroad  
**BsmtHalfBaths** : Basement half bathrooms  
**GarageQuality** : Garage quality  
