</p><h2>Submission Format</h2>
<p><strong>For every author in the dataset</strong>, submission files should contain two columns: ID and y. 
</p><p>The file should contain a header and have the following format:</p>
<pre>ID,y<br>1,1<br></pre>","# Dataset Description

