<li><strong>rate_code</strong> - Rate code for the trip (1 = Standard, 2 = Airport, 3 = Connaught Place, 4 = Noida, 5 = Negotiated Fare, 6 = Pooled ride)</li>
<li><strong>stored_flag</strong> - Flag which signifies whether trip data was immediately sent to Chh-OLA¡¯s database or not (Y=Yes, N=No, because of connection error)</li>
