<p><strong>Submission files should contain the predicted probability of bankruptcy for each test sample.</p>
<p>The file should contain a header and have the following format:</p>
<pre>ID, class<br />1, 0.01<br /><span style=""font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4em;"">2, 0.20<br />3, 0.99<br /></span><span style=""font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4em;"">4, 0.40<br /></span><span style=""font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4em;"">etc.</span></pre>","# Dataset Description

