2034,hacktheu2019,"# Description

Fraudulent credit card purchases are among the hardest events to detect, especially when criminals are smart about it. There is also a lack of well labeled data. A lot of training datasets contain very few fraudulent purchases among the plenty regular purchases.

Your quest if you choose to accept it will be to classify, to the best of your ability, the provided credit card purchase dataset. The one or few that achieve the best score will win an NVIDIA Jetson Nano, courtesy of HackTheU & partners. Scoring details are explained on the evaluation page. 

All are welcome! You can be a Machine Learning guru or even a complete beginner. Enjoy!
----------------------
# Evaluation

The evaluation metric is Categorization Accuracy. This is simply the percentage of correct predictions.
