<pre>id, target<br />1, 100000.000001<br />2, 100001.000002<br />... ...</pre>
<p>§±§â§Ú§Þ§Ö§â §â§Ö§Ù§å§Ý§î§ä§Ñ§ä§à§Ó §á§â§Ö§Õ§ã§ä§Ñ§Ó§Ý§Ö§ß §Ó §æ§Ñ§Û§Ý§Ö <a href=""https://www.kaggle.com/c/findata-casco/download/OSX29SoXiXxW4ybUsamP%2Fversions%2F94Tq649BXNtHm9aLrqhN%2Ffiles%2Fcasco_sample.csv"">casco_sample.csv</a>.</p>
