<p>§³§à§â§Ö§Ó§ß§à§Ó§Ñ§ß§Ú§Ö §á§â§à§Ó§à§Õ§Ú§ä§ã§ñ §ß§Ñ §á§Ý§Ñ§ä§æ§à§â§Þ§Ö <a href=""https://www.kaggle.com/c/findata-casco/"">kaggle</a>, §Õ§Ý§ñ §å§é§Ñ§ã§ä§Ú§ñ §ß§Ö§à§Ò§ç§à§Õ§Ú§Þ§à §Ù§Ñ§â§Ö§Ô§Ú§ã§ä§â§Ú§â§à§Ó§Ñ§ä§î§ã§ñ §ß§Ñ §ï§ä§à§Û §á§Ý§Ñ§ä§æ§à§â§Þ§Ö §á§à §ã§ã§í§Ý§Ü§Ö <a href=""https://kaggle.com/account/register"">https://kaggle.com/account/register</a>. §±§â§Ú §ï§ä§à§Þ §ß§Ö§à§Ò§ç§à§Õ§Ú§Þ§à §Ú§ã§á§à§Ý§î§Ù§à§Ó§Ñ§ä§î §ã§Ó§à§Ö §ß§Ñ§ã§ä§à§ñ§ë§Ö§Ö §Ú§Þ§ñ. §±§à§ã§Ý§Ö §ï§ä§à§Ô§à §Þ§à§Ø§ß§à §à§Ù§ß§Ñ§Ü§à§Þ§Ú§ä§î§ã§ñ §ã §á§à§Õ§â§à§Ò§ß§í§Þ§Ú §á§â§Ñ§Ó§Ú§Ý§Ñ§Þ§Ú §ã§à§â§Ö§Ó§ß§à§Ó§Ñ§ß§Ú§ñ §Ú §Ù§Ñ§Ô§â§å§Ù§Ú§ä§î §Ú§ã§ç§à§Õ§ß§í§Ö §Õ§Ñ§ß§ß§í§Ö §á§à §Ñ§Õ§â§Ö§ã§å <a href=""https://www.kaggle.com/c/findata-casco/"">https://www.kaggle.com/c/findata-casco</a>.</p>
<p>§³§â§Ñ§Ù§å §á§à§ã§Ý§Ö §Ù§Ñ§Ô§â§å§Ù§Ü§Ú §Ò§å§Õ§Ö§ä §Ñ§Ó§ä§à§Þ§Ñ§ä§Ú§é§Ö§ã§Ü§Ú §â§Ñ§ã§ã§é§Ú§ä§í§Ó§Ñ§ä§î§ã§ñ §ã§â§Ö§Õ§ß§ñ§ñ §Ñ§Ò§ã§à§Ý§ð§ä§ß§Ñ§ñ §à§ê§Ú§Ò§Ü§Ñ §á§â§Ö§Õ§ã§Ü§Ñ§Ù§Ñ§ß§Ú§ñ (<code>Mean Absolute Error</code>) §Ú §â§Ö§Û§ä§Ú§ß§Ô §å§é§Ñ§ã§ä§ß§Ú§Ü§à§Ó §ß§Ñ §à§ã§ß§à§Ó§Ñ§ß§Ú§Ú §á§å§Ò§Ý§Ú§é§ß§à§Ô§à §ä§Ö§ã§ä§à§Ó§à§Ô§à §ß§Ñ§Ò§à§â§Ñ §Õ§Ñ§ß§ß§í§ç.</p>
<p>§²§Ö§Ù§å§Ý§î§ä§Ñ§ä§í §Ò§å§Õ§å§ä §Ñ§Ó§ä§à§Þ§Ñ§ä§Ú§é§Ö§ã§Ü§Ú §á§Ö§â§Ö§ã§é§Ú§ä§í§Ó§Ñ§ä§î§ã§ñ §á§à §Ñ§Õ§â§Ö§ã§å <a href=""https://www.kaggle.com/c/findata-casco/submit"">https://www.kaggle.com/c/findata-casco/submit</a>?§Õ§à 23:59 31 §Õ§Ö§Ü§Ñ§Ò§â§ñ 2038 §Ô§à§Õ§Ñ.</p>
<h1>§¨§Ö§Ý§Ñ§Ö§Þ §å§ã§á§Ö§ç§Ñ!</h1>

<a name=""en""></a>
<p>Challenge participants delevop models for predicting the vehicle insurance value.</p>
<p>For 24&nbsp;511  vehicle insurance contracts, the values ??of a number of signs are known, including gender, age, driving experience and driver bonus-malus coefficient, type, brand, model, year of manufacture, country of manufacture, engine power and volume, as well as insurance cost vehicle (<a href=""https://www.kaggle.com/c/findata-casco/download/OSX29SoXiXxW4ybUsamP%2Fversions%2F94Tq649BXNtHm9aLrqhN%2Ffiles%2Fcasco_train.csv"">casco_train.csv</a> file).</p>
<p>It is required to build a model that predicts the insured value of the client¡¯s vehicle (target attribute) for 3662 contracts from the test data set (<a href=""https://www.kaggle.com/c/findata-casco/download/OSX29SoXiXxW4ybUsamP%2Fversions%2F94Tq649BXNtHm9aLrqhN%2Ffiles%2Fcasco_test.csv"">casco_test.csv</a> file).</p>
<p>The quality metric is <code>Mean Absolute Percentage Error</code>:</p>
<p>\[MAPE = \frac{100\%}{n} \sum_{i=1}^n{\frac{|\hat{y_i}-y_i|}{y_i}}.\]</p>
<p>One point is that for almost all brands there are different models representing them.</p>
<p>Participants must  <a href=""https://inclass.kaggle.com/c/findata-casco/submit"">upload</a>?a file with the predicted insurance value of vehicles (<code>target</code>) for 3662 contracts from the test data set  to the championship platform. Half of these contracts relate to a public test data set, the other half to a closed test data set.</p>
<h2>Solution Submission Form</h2>
<p><strong>The participant of the competition must submit a file in  <code>csv</code> format, the first line of which contains a set of headers <code>id, target</code>, and in the next lines for each contract from the test data set the identifier <code>id</code> and the corresponding predicted value of the <code>target</code> - the insurance value of the vehicle under this contract as follows:</p>
<pre>id, target<br />1, 100000.000001<br />2, 100001.000002<br />... ...</pre>
<p>An example of the results is provided in the <a href=""https://www.kaggle.com/c/findata-casco/download/OSX29SoXiXxW4ybUsamP%2Fversions%2F94Tq649BXNtHm9aLrqhN%2Ffiles%2Fcasco_sample.csv"">casco_sample.csv</a> file.</p>
<p>Participants cannot form teams. Each participant can submit several results, but not more than 10 per day. The final ranking will take into account the best model.</p>
<p>The competition is held on <a href=""https://www.kaggle.com/c/findata-casco/"">kaggle</a>, to participate you must register at  <a href=""https://kaggle.com/account/register"">https://kaggle.com/account/register</a>. You must use your real name. After that, you can familiarize yourself with the detailed rules of the competition and download the source data at  <a href=""https://www.kaggle.com/c/findata-casco/"">https://www.kaggle.com/c/findata-casco</a>.</p>
<p>Immediately after loading, the <code>Mean Absolute Error</code> and the rating of participants will be automatically calculated based on the public test data set.</p>
<p>Results will be automatically recounted at <a href=""https://www.kaggle.com/c/findata-casco/submit"">https://www.kaggle.com/c/findata-casco/submit</a>?until 23:59 on December 31, 2038.</p>
<h1>We wish you success!</h1>
----------------------
# Evaluation

<p>§¬§Ñ§é§Ö§ã§ä§Ó§à §Þ§à§Õ§Ö§Ý§Ú §à§è§Ö§ß§Ú§Ó§Ñ§Ö§ä§ã§ñ §ã §á§à§Þ§à§ë§î§ð §ã§â§Ö§Õ§ß§Ö§Û §à§ä§ß§à§ã§Ú§ä§Ö§Ý§î§ß§à§Û §à§ê§Ú§Ò§Ü§Ú §á§â§Ö§Õ§ã§Ü§Ñ§Ù§Ñ§ß§Ú§ñ (<code>Mean Absolute Percentage Error</code>):</p>
<p>\[MAPE = \frac{100\%}{n} \sum_{i=1}^n{\frac{|\hat{y_i}-y_i|}{y_i}}.\]</p>
<p>§¹§Ö§Þ §Þ§Ö§ß§î§ê§Ö §Ù§ß§Ñ§é§Ö§ß§Ú§Ö <code>MAPE</code>, §ä§Ö§Þ §Ý§å§é§ê§Ö §â§Ö§Ù§å§Ý§î§ä§Ñ§ä.</p>

<p>The quality of the model is estimated using the <code>Mean Absolute Percentage Error</code>:</p>
<p>\[MAPE = \frac{100\%}{n} \sum_{i=1}^n{\frac{|\hat{y_i}-y_i|}{y_i}}.\]</p>
<p>The lower the <code>MAPE</code> value, the better the result.</p>","# Dataset Description

<h3>§°§á§Ú§ã§Ñ§ß§Ú§Ö §á§à§Ý§Ö§Û / Data Description</h3>
<ul>
<li><code>column_1</code> - §á§à§Ý §Ó§à§Õ§Ú§ä§Ö§Ý§ñ / gender of the driver;</li>
<li><code>column_2</code> - §ã§ä§Ñ§Ø §Ó§à§Ø§Õ§Ö§ß§Ú§ñ / driving experience;</li>
<li><code>column_3</code> - §ã§Ö§Þ§Ö§Û§ß§à§Ö §á§à§Ý§à§Ø§Ö§ß§Ú§Ö §Ó§à§Õ§Ú§ä§Ö§Ý§ñ / marital status of the driver;</li>
<li><code>column_4</code> - §Ô§à§â§à§Õ §â§Ö§Ô§Ú§ã§ä§â§Ñ§è§Ú§Ú §Ó§à§Õ§Ú§ä§Ö§Ý§ñ / city of driver registration;</li>
<li><code>column_5</code> - §Ô§à§â§à§Õ §â§Ö§Ô§Ú§ã§ä§â§Ñ§è§Ú§Ú §Õ§à§Ô§à§Ó§à§â§Ñ / city of contract registration;</li>
<li><code>column_6</code> - §Þ§Ñ§Ü§ã§Ú§Þ§Ñ§Ý§î§ß§Ñ§ñ §á§â§à§ã§â§à§é§Ü§Ñ §á§à §Ó§í§á§Ý§Ñ§ä§Ñ§Þ / maximum delay in payments;</li>
<li><code>column_7</code> - §ä§Ú§á §Õ§Ó§Ú§Ô§Ñ§ä§Ö§Ý§ñ / engine type;</li>
<li><code>column_8</code> - §á§â§à§Ò§Ö§Ô §ä§â§Ñ§ß§ã§á§à§â§ä§ß§à§Ô§à §ã§â§Ö§Õ§ã§ä§Ó§Ñ / vehicle mileage;</li>
<li><code>column_9</code> - §Ô§à§Õ §á§â§à§Ú§Ù§Ó§à§Õ§ã§ä§Ó§Ñ §ä§â§Ñ§ß§ã§á§à§â§ä§ß§à§Ô§à §ã§â§Ö§Õ§ã§ä§Ó§Ñ / vehicle manufacturing year;</li>
<li><code>column_10</code> - §Þ§à§ë§ß§à§ã§ä§î §Õ§Ó§Ú§Ô§Ñ§ä§Ö§Ý§ñ §Ó §Ý§à§ê§Ñ§Õ§Ú§ß§í§ç §ã§Ú§Ý§Ñ§ç / engine power in horsepower;</li>
<li><code>column_11</code> - §Ü§à§Ý§Ú§é§Ö§ã§ä§Ó§à §Õ§à§Ô§à§Ó§à§â§à§Ó §Ü§Ý§Ú§Ö§ß§ä§Ñ / number of client contracts;</li>
<li><code>column_12</code> - §Ü§à§Ý§Ú§é§Ö§ã§ä§Ó§à §Õ§à§Ô§à§Ó§à§â§à§Ó §ä§â§Ñ§ß§ã§á§à§â§ä§ß§à§Ô§à §ã§â§Ö§Õ§ã§ä§Ó§Ñ / number of vehicle contracts;</li>
<li><code>column_13</code> - §Ó§à§Ù§â§Ñ§ã§ä §Ü§Ý§Ú§Ö§ß§ä§Ñ / client age;</li>
<li><code>column_14</code> - §ä§Ú§á §ä§â§Ñ§ß§ã§á§à§â§ä§ß§à§Ô§à §ã§â§Ö§Õ§ã§ä§Ó§Ñ / vehicle type;</li>
<li><code>column_15</code> - §ã§ä§â§Ñ§ß§Ñ-§á§â§à§Ú§Ù§Ó§à§Õ§Ú§ä§Ö§Ý§î §ä§â§Ñ§ß§ã§á§à§â§ä§ß§à§Ô§à §ã§â§Ö§Õ§ã§ä§Ó§Ñ / vehicle manufacturing country;</li>
