Note: Because the private test set is held outside of Kaggle's platform, the private leaderboard will not be revealed immediately. We have estimated the scoring timeframe, but this is subject to revision.

All deadlines are at 11:59:00 PM UTC on the corresponding day unless otherwise noted. The competition organizers reserve the right to update the contest timeline if they deem it necessary.
