2120,uis-dat6402019-2b,"# Description

The task is to implement a learning-to-rank approach for web search and evaluate it using a standard test collection. See [this page](https://github.com/kbalog/uis-dat640-fall2019/tree/master/assignments/assignment-2b) for the complete description.
----------------------
# Evaluation

The evaluation metric for this competition is NDCG@20.

## Submission Format

Submission files should contain two columns: QueryId and DocumentId. For each query, up to 20 documents may be returned, in decreasing order of relevance (i.e., more relevant first).

The file should contain a header and have the following format:

<pre>
QueryId,DocumentId
201,clueweb12-0108wb-86-18203
201,clueweb12-0209wb-62-29857
201,clueweb12-0300tw-49-08295
...
202,clueweb12-0001wb-80-19541
