</p><h2>Submission Format</h2>
<p><strong>For every image in the dataset</strong>, submission files should contain two columns: ImageId and Class. ImageId should be the file name in test folder (Eg. 1.png). Class value should be the vowel class respectively followed by a underscore and consonant class (Eg. V0_C0)
</p><p>The file should contain a header and have the following format:</p>

