2282,appstate-cs-07,"# Description

<p>This is dataset 07.</p>
----------------------
# Evaluation

<p>This competition is evaluated using AUC and requires binary predictions (0 or 1):</p>
<p>\[ BinaryAUC = \frac{Sen + Spe}{2} \]</p>
<p>\[ Sen = \frac{tp}{tp + fn} \]</p>
<p>\[ Spe = \frac{tn}{tn + fp} \]</p>
<h2>Submission Format</h2>
<p><strong>For every row in the test set</strong>, submission files should contain two columns: Id and Prediction.   The Id corresponds to the Id in the test data file.</p>
<p>The file should contain a header and have the following format:</p>
<pre>Id,Prediction<br />1,1<br />2,0<br />3,0<br />4,1<br />etc.</pre>","# Dataset Description

<h2>File descriptions</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>kaggle_07_train.csv</strong> - the training set</li>
<li><strong>kaggle_07_test.csv</strong> - the test set</li>
<li><strong>kaggle_07_submission.csv</strong> - a sample submission file in the correct format</li>
</ul>
<h2>Data fields</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Id</strong> - a unique Id for each sample</li>
<li><strong>x_1</strong> - feature 1</li>
<li><strong>...</strong></li>
<li><strong>x_22000</strong> - feature 22000</li>
<li><strong>y</strong> - target</li>
<li><strong>Prediction</strong> - Your prediction</li>
</ul>",True,True
