2319,projectrev,"# Description

Recently, there has been an increasing awareness in standard of health in Nigeria. This leads to increase in health claims for Health Maintenance Organizations as members visit hospital more frequently than before.

In order to keep to brand promise of prompt payment of claims, HEALTHINESS HMO will like to anticipate the total claims request in the coming months so as to plan resources around it.
You're required to help address this business question.

Good luck!
----------------------
# Evaluation

RMSE scoring metrics will be used for evaluating submissions.","# Dataset Description

This competition is controlled.
Only sample submission file can be found and others are provided during the exercise.",True,True
