2405,ska-data-challenge-test,"# Description

<p>This is a dummy data challenge to explore the features on the Kaggle InClass competition platform. The data for this is from https://www.kaggle.com/paultimothymooney/how-to-setup-an-inclass-competition/data</p>
<p>https://www.kaggle.com/c/cloud-faculty-institute-workshop/data</p>
<p>This dataset is originally from the National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases. </p>

<p>
Code in notebooks is based off of code in this blog https://towardsdatascience.com/solving-a-simple-classification-problem-with-python-fruits-lovers-edition-d20ab6b071d2</p>
----------------------
