CHAS£ºCharles River dummy variable (= 1 if tract bounds river; 0 otherwise)<br>
NOX£ºnitric oxides concentration (parts per 10 million)<br>
RM£ºaverage number of rooms per dwelling<br>
AGE£ºproportion of owner-occupied units built prior to 1940<br>
DIS£ºweighted distances to five Boston employment centres<br>
RAD£ºindex of accessibility to radial highways<br>
