This challenge is part of the [FGVC7 workshop](https://sites.google.com/view/fgvc7) at [CVPR 2020](http://cvpr2020.thecvf.com/). Teams with top submissions, at the discretion of the workshop organizers, will be invited to present their work at the workshop.

