The submission format for the Kaggle competition is a csv file with the following format:
```
Id,Category
0,25 4 122 99 23
1,0 23 33 32 152
2,143 177 134 113 199
```
The `Id` corresponds to the test image Id. The `Category` corresponds to the top five predicted categories separated by space. You should have one row for each test image. Although we only
use top-1 error rate for the leaderboard, the top-5 predictions will be used for more detailed analysis by the competition organizers. A [sample solution](https://github.com/cvl-umass/semi-inat-2020/blob/master/solution_sample.csv) is provided.
