<h2> Submission File <h2>
<p>The file should contain a header and have the following format:</p>
<pre>ID,Stage1.Output.Measurement0.U.Actual<br />1,10,1<br /><span style=""font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4em;"">2,10.01<br />3, 11<br /></span><span style=""font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4em;"">15,19<br /></span><span style=""font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4em;"">etc.</span></pre>","# Dataset Description

