This is a Data Science Academy Kazakhstan evaluation project.

You are given a dataset of specialists with the grades they earned in the university and the salary they receive now. 

Your main goal is to predict a salary based on university grades and the job title.

The dataset is fully syntetic, the data is not real. Try to find out how different jobs depend on the courses. For example, for a finance auditor it is more important to know accounting than physics. For a software developer it is more important to know programming, but algebra is also important, although not that much. Based on these observations it will be much easier to find the solution.

----------------------
# Evaluation

