<li><strong>sampleSubmission.csv</strong> - a sample submission file in the correc<p>This page shows up underneath the data files. Here you describe what files you have provided and the format of each. There is no single format for this page that is appropriate for all competitons, but you should strive to describe as much as you can here. A little time spent describing the data here can save a lot of time answering questions later.</p>
