SaleCondition : Condition of sale<br>
LivingArea : Above grade (ground) living area square feet<br>
Lot Config : Lot configuration<br>
FenceQuality : fence quality<br>
SaleType : type of sale<br>
HalfBaths : Half baths above grade<br>
Neighborhood : Physical locations within city limits<br>
HeatingQuality : Heating quality and condition<br>
LotFrontage : Linear feet of street connected to property<br>
RoofMaterial : Roof material<br>
Exterior1 : Exterior covering on house<br>
Foundation : Type of foundation<br>
HouseType : Type of dwelling<br>
YearRemodelled : Remodel date<br>
MasVnrArea : Masonry veneer area in square feet<br>
Misc Feature : Miscellaneous feature not covered in other categories<br>
GarageFinish : Interior finish of the garage<br>
ExteriorQual : Exterior material quality<br>
UtilitiesAvailable : Type of utilities available<br>
HouseStyle : Style of dwelling<br>
MasVnrType : Masonry veneer type<br>
FireplaceQuality : Fireplace quality<br>
EnclosedPorchArea : Enclosed porch area in square feet<br>
BsmtCondition : General condition of the basement<br>
PoolSize : Pool area in square feet<br>
BsmtHeight : Height of the basement<br>
BsmtFullBaths : Basement full bathrooms<br>
ScreenPorchArea : Screen porch area in square feet<br>
Misc : Value of miscellaneous feature<br>
BsmtFinishType2 : Quality of second finished area (if present)<br>
TotalRooms : Total rooms above grade (does not include bathrooms)<br>
YearBuilt : Original construction date<br>
YearSold : year sold<br>
BsmtFinish2Area : Type 2 finished square feet<br>
PoolQuality : Pool quality<br>
OpenPorchArea : Open porch area in square feet<br>
Fireplaces : number of fireplaces<br>
RoofType : style of the roof<br>
Functional : Home functionality rating<br>
ExteriorCond : Present condition of the material on the exterior<br>
GarageCondition : Garage condition<br>
TotalBsmtArea : Total square feet of basement area<br>
Electrical : Electrical system<br>
SeasonPorchArea : Three season porch area in square feet<br>
LowQualityFinishArea : Low quality finished square feet (all floors)<br>
ProximityToMainRoad : Proximity to main road or railroad<br>
BsmtHalfBaths : Basement half bathrooms<br>
GarageQuality : Garage quality<br>
WoodDeckArea : Wood deck area in square feet<br>
ZoningClass : The general zoning classification<br>
Bedrooms : Number of bedrooms above basement level<br>
TypeOfAlleyAccess : Type of alley access<br>
FullBaths : Full bathrooms above grade<br>
OverallRating : Overall condition rating<br>
BsmtFinishType1 : Quality of basement finished area<br>
TypeOfRoadAccess : Type of road access<br>
MonthSold : month sold<br>
GarageCars : Size of garage in car capacity<br>
Shape : General shape of property<br>
Flatness : Flatness of the property<br>
HeatingType : type of heating<br>
Central Air : Central air conditioning<br>
SlopeOfProperty : land slope of property<br>
Exterior2 : Exterior covering on house (if more than one material)<br>
GarageArea : Size of garage in square feet<br>
BsmtFinish1Area : Type 1 finished square<br>
Quality : Overall material and finish quality<br>
GarageType : Garage location<br>
LotSize : Lot size in square feet<br>
Kitchens : Number of kitchens<br>
GarageYearBuilt : Year garage was built<br>
BuildingClass : The building class<br>
2ndFloorArea : Second Floor square feet<br>
1stFloorArea : First Floor square feet<br>
SalePrice : the property's sale price in dollars.<br>

Kindly reach out to your TAs for clarifications.<br>

This dataset is a adaptation of an housing dataset (which will mentioned after the competition) and is strictly for academic learning purposes.",True,True
