?? TA: Jihu Kim: paransky9577@gmail.com
?? TA: Byunghoon Hwang: byunghoonhwang97@gmail.com

Only questions about the dataset and competitions are acceptable

----------------------
# Submission Format

You must submit CSV file format for get test accuracy

Here is an example
| Id | category |
| --- | --- |
| 01025 | cheetah |
| 5450 | jauger |
| 026 | jaguar |
|  ... | ... |

Id column is id number of an image file
The class column is class(string) of an image
You can refer example code to make submission file","# Dataset Description

