- X1 = height in feet
- X2 = weight in pounds
- X3 = percent of successful field goals (out of 100 attempted)
- X4 = percent of successful free throws (out of 100 attempted)
- X5 = average points scored per game 

Dataset is split into two files.

- train_data.csv - Training data set for model fitting
- test_data.csv - Testing data set for validation

Sample submission file.
- sampleSubmissionFile.csv - Submission file format. Use this format when uploading your predictions for the testing dataset.",True,True
