3216,duc2020datathon,"# Description

¡°Welcome to the Quantitative part of the DUC Datathon 2020 organised by SPE Calgary and Untapped Energy. If you are not registered for the DUC Datathon, please do so here: https://specalgary.com/initiative/5ee244727f8b37094af25c4d 

This Kaggle site is where you will upload your solutions to the TVD prediction challenge and they will be automatically tested against 1- the public dataset so you can see how your model performs, and 2 - against the private dataset. You will not see the results of your model against the private dataset until the winners of this competition are announced at the Closing ceremony on 23 August. 

Data is available to registered participants only. Please register using the link above to receive access to the data. 

About SPE Calgary ¨C Calgary¡¯s local section of SPE International. SPE is the largest individual member organization serving managers, engineers, scientists and other professionals worldwide in the oil and gas industry.

About Untapped Energy - A not-for-profit, grassroots-led community with representation from industry, government, academia and the broader public, seeking to collectively solve problems and generate innovation for the Canadian energy industry using data science and analytics.

----------------------
# Evaluation

RMSE is used as an evaluation metrics","# Dataset Description

