  <li>six_months</li>
  <li>multiple_tbi</li>
 <li>gender</li>
  <li>asian</li>
  <li>black</li>
  <li>white</li>
  <li>other</li>
  <li>hispanic</li>
  <li>weight</li>  
<li>height</li>
  <li>start_time</li>
<li>stop_time</li>
  <li>valid</li>
<li>BMI</li>
  <li>obese</li>
</ol>
     

It is information about the general info of participants. 


train_walking_data(trainset).csv has
[1] ""X""          ""id""         ""event_time"" ""accX""       ""accY""       ""accZ""      
 [7] ""gyroX""      ""gyroY""      ""gyroZ""      ""rot1""       ""rot2""       ""rot3""      
[13] ""rot4""       ""rot5""       ""rot6""       ""rot7""       ""rot8""       ""rot9""      
[19] ""rotX""       ""rotY""       ""rotZ""  

