### Description
You have raw data about Lviv apartments from dom.ria.com. You need to explore which columns from data can be used for price prediction and how to represent data for model training.

Feel free to ask any questions

### Aims
Learn data exploration and processing with Pandas
Learn linear regression with Sklearn
