# Evaluation

<p>The evaluation metric for this competition is <a href=""https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mean_absolute_percentage_error"">Mean Absolute Percentage Error (MAPE)
</a>. The MAPE score is given by:</p>
<p>\[ MAPE = \dfrac{1}{n}\sum_{j=1}^{n} \|\dfrac{ \hat{y}_j - y_j }{y_j} \|\]</p>
<h2>Submission Format</h2>
<p><strong>For every house in the dataset</strong>, submission files should contain two columns: id and '§¸?§ß§Ñ'. </p>
