----------------------
# Evaluation

<p>Submissions will be judged based on their RMSE on the test set up here on kaggle. Your ""score"" on the public leaderboard is the RMSE on 30% of the test set. Your REAL score on the competition is the RMSE on the remaining 70% of the test set. A great score on the private leaderboard may not give a great score on the rest of the test set.</p>

<h>Submission Format</h>
A submission file should contain two columns: Id and SalePrice; be sure to respect the capitalization.

The file should contain a header and have the following format:

Id,SalePrice
