# About

<br>
<h2>About this Competition</h2>

<p>This competition is part of the AI & ML DeMystified workshop oragnized by the IEEE MPSTME Student chapter. A panel will review the top submissions for the competition based on the description of the methods provided. Attending the workshop is not required to participate in the competition, however only individuals that are attending the workshop will be considered for Certificate of merit.</p>

<p>There is no cash prize for this competition. </p>","# Dataset Description

