<li>Instant Air Atmospheric Pressure (millibars)</li>
<li>Maximum Air Atmospheric Pressure (millibars)</li>
<li>Minimum Air Atmospheric Pressure (millibars) </li>
<li>Instant Wind Speed (meters per second)  </li>
<li> Wind Direction (radius degrees)</li>
<li>Wind Gust Intensity (meters per second)  </li>
<li>Solar radiation   </li>
<li>Precipitation (millimeters)   </li>
</strong></ul><strong>

<p>
The data was taken hourly from different weather stations in South America. Therefore information regarding the time, date and location of the station is also available.  </p>
