3548,applai-seniors-competition-a1,"# Description

<p>A factory wants to automate the selection process of selecting if a product would be accepted or not. the product goes through two tests in the quality line, each test outputs a score, your mission is to build a model to automate the acceptance/rejection procedure based on the two quality scores.</p>
<h2>Data Information</h2>
<p>ProductID: The ID of the product</p>
<p>Alpha Test: The first quality test score</p>
<p>Beta Test: The Second quality test score</p>
<p>Status: The status of product if accepted or rejected</p>","# Dataset Description

<h2>Data Information</h2>
