<img title=¡±elf¡± src=""https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-media/competitions/Santa/elf_small.jpg"" style=""float: right; width: 350px"">

<p><i>It's the most wonderful time of the year <br>
With the elves eating candy <br>
