3746,vub-animal-classification-nn-20,"# Description

It's all the same as before, except now you are allowed to use anything related to neural networks. This includes Convolutional Neural Networks, Deep Learning, Transfer Learning etc.

If I see there are enough entries here from several students, I will also award one copy of 'Human Compatible' to the winner, so go for it!
----------------------
# Evaluation

Again, the multi-class log loss.","# Dataset Description

Use the same data as for the original competition. See https://www.kaggle.com/c/vub-animal-classification-20/data

(The data provided here is just one picture of a dog. It was necessary for me to be able to start the competition.)",True,True
3747,uwec-cs-491-final-2020,"# Description

<p>This Kaggle competition will assess the accuracy of your predictions for the final project.
</p>
<p>
Click on the ""Data"" link above to get the data. Click ""Rules"" to read the rules for the competition.</p>

----------------------
# Evaluation

<p>The evaluation metric for this competition is the area under the ROC curve.</p>
<h2>Submission Format</h2>
<p>Submission files should contain two columns: patient_id and Predicted. The patient_ids should match the values in the diabetes_test.csv file.  The Predicted values should be the predicted probability that *returned* equals 1.

<p>The file should contain a header and have the following format:</p>
<pre>patient_id,Predicted<br>16100145,0.5<br></pre>","# Dataset Description

<p>The goal of this competition is to use the data in the training set to build one or more models to predict *returned*. To check the accuracy of your model, you will use your model to predict *returned for each row in the file diabetes_test.csv.</p>

<h2>File descriptions</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>diabetes_train.csv</strong> - the training set</li>
<li><strong>diabetes_test.csv</strong> - the test set</li>
<li><strong>diabetes_sample_submission.csv</strong> - a sample submission file in the correct format</li>
<li><strong>IDs_mapping.csv</strong> - a data dictionary for the variables admission_type_id, discharge_disposition_id, and admission_source_id</li>
</ul>
<h2>Data fields</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>patient_id</strong> - an anonymous id unique to a given patient</li>
<li><strong>race</strong> - the patient's race</li>
<li><strong>age</strong> - a categorical variable indicating the patient's age category, in years</li>
<li><strong>weight</strong> - a categorical variable indicating the patient's weight, in pounds</li>
<li><strong>admission_type_id</strong> - a categorical variable indicating the type of hospital admission, e.g. emergency, urgent, or elective</li>

<li><strong>discharge_disposition_id</strong> - a categorical variable indicating how the patient was discharged, e.g. to home, to a nursing home, or died </li>
<li><strong>admission_source_id</strong> - a categorical variable indicating how the patient was admitted, e.g. by physician referral, from the emergency room, or by transfer from another hospital</li>
<li><strong>time_in_hospital</strong> - number of days between admission and dischage</li>
<li><strong>payer_code</strong> - a categorical variable indicating who paid the hospital bill, e.g. Blue Cross/Blue Shield, Medicare, or self-pay</li>
<li><strong>medical_specialty</strong> - the specialty of the admitting physician</li>
<li><strong>num_lab_procedures</strong> - number of lab tests performed while the patient was in the hospital</li>
<li><strong>num_procedures</strong> - number of procedures (other than lab tests) performed while the patient was in the hospital</li>
<li><strong>num_medications</strong> - number of different types of medication administered to the patient while they were in the hospital</li>
<li><strong>number_outpatient</strong> - number of outpatient medical visits the patient made during the previous year</li>
<li><strong>number_emergency</strong> - number of emergency room visits the patient made during the previous year</li>
<li><strong>number_inpatient</strong> - number of times the patient was in the hospital during the previous year</li>
<li><strong>number_diagnoses</strong> - number of diagnoses </li>
<li><strong>max_glu_serum</strong> - a categorical variable indicating the patient's maximum value on a glucose serum test.  ""None"" indicates the test was not performed. </li>
<li><strong>A1Cresult</strong> -  a categorical variable indicating the patient's result on a test of HbA1c.  "">8"" indicates the result was greater than 8%; "">7"" indicates a result between 7% and 8%; ""normal"" indicates less than 7%; ""none"" indicates not measured. </li>
<li><strong>metformin, repaglinide, ... glyburide-metformin</strong> - medications.  ""up"" indicates the dosage was increased during the hospital stay; ""down"" indicates the dosage was decreased; ""steady"" indicates the patient takes the medication, but their dosage did not change; ""no"" indicates the patient does not take the medication.</li>
<li><strong>change</strong> - a categorical variable indicating whether there was a change in diabetic medications (either dosage or type) </li>
<li><strong>diabetesMed</strong> - a categorical variable indicating whether any diabetic medication was prescribed</li>
<li><strong>returned</strong> - a categorical variable indicating whether the patient returned for readmission to the hospital</li>
<li><strong>diagnosis1</strong> - the patient's primary diagnosis category, as determined by their ICD9 billing code</li>
<li><strong>diagnosis2</strong> - the patient's secondary diagnosis category</li>
<li><strong>diagnosis3</strong> - additional secondary diagnosis, if applicable</li>
<li><strong>sex</strong> - the patient's biological sex</li>
</ul>",True,True
3748,interbank20,"# Description

<h2>Requisitos para participar</h2>
Para poder participar del evento deber¨¢n inscribirse en el [sitio oficial](https://interbank.pe/datathon-interbank-inscripcion?rfid=datathon:detalle:casilla-3:link). S¨®lo quienes se inscriban en ese sitio antes del fin de la competencia ser¨¢n elegibles para ser premiados. 

To take part in this competition please sign up on the [official site] (https://interbank.pe/datathon-interbank-inscripcion?rfid=datathon:detalle:casilla-3:link). Only users registered before the competition deadline are eligible for a price.

<h2>Descripci¨®n</h2>
<p>El reto consiste en desarrollar un algoritmo predictivo que estime la probabilidad de default o un score que ordene en funci¨®n de la misma, respecto de los emprendedores que han adquirido un pr¨¦stamo personal o un pr¨¦stamo de micro o peque?a empresa en el mes de febrero, del a?o 2018 para entrenamiento y 2019 para evaluaci¨®n </p>

<h2>Base de entrenamiento</h2>
<p>La base de entrenamiento contiene informaci¨®n ofuscada del historial crediticio de los emprendedores. Se incluyen tambi¨¦n variables sociodemogr¨¢ficas, sobre tributos(SUNAT) y del censo 2017.</p>
<h2>Evaluaci¨®n</h2>
<p>Se evaluar¨¢ a los participantes en funci¨®n del ¨¢rea bajo la curva ROC, de mayor a menor. Durante la competencia se reportar¨¢n resultados sobre un subconjunto del set de evaluaci¨®n, pero los resultados finales se calcular¨¢n sobre los datos restantes</p>

<h2>Plazos</h2>
Se aceptar¨¢n resultados desde el 10 de Diciembre del 2020 (una vez lanzado el reto) hasta el 11 de Febrero del 2021 a las 11:59 pm UTC-5

<h2>Premios y t¨¦rminos</h2>
Se pueden leer en [sitio oficial](https://interbank.pe/datathon-interbank-inscripcion?rfid=datathon:detalle:casilla-3:link). Por el solo hecho de participar, estos t¨¦rminos se dan por conocidos y aceptados

<h2>Requisitos de c¨®digo</h2>
Para hacerse acreedor de cualquier premio, los candidatos deber¨¢n construir entre 1 y 3 notebooks que partan de los datos crudos y generen la soluci¨®n final. Esto garantizar¨¢ la legalidad y reproducibilidad de los resultados.","# Dataset Description

<h2>Descripci¨®n de los datos</h2>
En todos los archivos, la columna ""key_value"" corresponde a la identificaci¨®n ofuscada de la persona, pero los ids no son compatibles entre conjuntos de datos (train|test). Es decir, el key_value = 1 de rcc_train no es la misma persona que el key_value = 1 de rcc_test.

<ol>
<li><strong>rcc_[train|test].csv</strong>: historial crediticio</li>
<ul>
<li><strong>codmes</strong>:  a?o y mes de la observaci¨®n</li>
<li><strong>condicion</strong>:  dias de atraso</li>
<li><strong>tipo_credito</strong>:  tipo de credito</li>
<li><strong>cod_instit_financiera</strong>:  codigo de la instituci¨®n financiera otorgante</li>
<li><strong>saldo</strong>:  monto de l¨ªnea o adeudado</li>
<li><strong>PRODUCTO</strong>:  tipo de producto, para la descripci¨®n cruzar con <strong>productos.csv</strong></li>
<li><strong>RIESGO_DIRECTO</strong>:  un indicador ordinal del riesgo de la persona</li>
<li><strong>COD_CLASIFICACION_DEUDOR</strong>:  un indicador categ¨®rico del riesgo de la persona</li>
</ul>

<li><strong>se_[train|test].csv</strong>: informaci¨®n socio-econ¨®mica</li>
<ul>
<li><strong>edad</strong>: edad.</li>
<li><strong>sexo</strong>: sexo.</li>
<li><strong>est_cvl</strong>: estado civil.</li>
<li><strong>sit_lab</strong>: situaci¨®n laboral.</li>
<li><strong>cod_ocu</strong>: c¨®digo de ocupaci¨®n.</li>
<li><strong>ctd_hijos</strong>: cantidad de hijos.</li>
<li><strong>flg_sin_email</strong>: tiene o no email.</li>
<li><strong>ctd_veh</strong>: cantidad de veh¨ªculos.</li>
<li><strong>cod_ubi</strong>: c¨®digo ubigeo.</li>
<li><strong>lgr_vot</strong>: lugar de votaci¨®n.</li>
<li><strong>prv</strong>: provincia.</li>
<li><strong>dto</strong>: departamento.</li>
<li><strong>rgn</strong>: region.</li>
<li><strong>tip_lvledu</strong>: tipo de nivel educativo.</li>
</ul>


<li><strong>sunat_[train|test].csv</strong>: informaci¨®n fiscal
<ul>
<li><strong>tipcontribuyente</strong>: tipo de contribuyente sunat.</li>
<li><strong>tippersona</strong>: tipo de persona sunat.</li>
<li><strong>ciiu</strong>: codigo de actividad economica.</li>
<li><strong>ubigeo</strong>: ubigeo.</li>
<li><strong>condiciondomicilio</strong>: condicion del domicilio fiscal.</li>
<li><strong>estadocontribuyente</strong>: estado del contribuyente.</li>
<li><strong>fecalta</strong>: fecha del alta.</li>
<li><strong>fecbaja</strong>: fecha de baja.</li>
<li><strong>codvia</strong>: codigo de tipo de via registrado.</li>
<li><strong>codzona</strong>: codigo de tipo de zona.</li>
<li><strong>contabilidad</strong>: Tipo de contabilidad registrada.</li>
<li><strong>facturacion</strong>: Tipo de facturacion registrada.</li>
<li><strong>domiciliado</strong>: condicion de domiciliado registrada.</li>
<li><strong>comercioexterior</strong>: Marca de actividad de comercio exterior.</li>
<li><strong>cargorele</strong>: Cargo del Representante Legal.</li>
