3783,3d-credit-card-fraud-detection,"# Description

## File descriptions
- train.csv - the training set
- test.csv - the test set
- sample_submission.csv - a sample submission file in the correct format

## Data fields
- ID transaction-id
- Time the seconds elapsed between each transaction and the first transaction in the dataset
V1, V2, ..., V28 the principal components obtained with PCA, the only features which have not been transformed with PCA
- Amount the transaction Amount
- Class it takes value 1 in case of fraud and 0 otherwise

----------------------
# Evaluation

Submissions are evaluated on **area under the ROC curve**  between the predicted probability and the observed target.


### Submission Format


Id,Class
109326,1
109327,0.1
09328,1
109329,0.9
----------------------
# Timeline

- Start Date: Dec 19, 2019
- Submission Deadline: Dec 26 2020, 11:59, IST","# Dataset Description

## File descriptions

- train.csv - training set

- test.csv -  test set

- Submission.csv - a sample submission file in the correct format

## Data fields

