3876,upec-ml-course-project-i,"# Description

<p>In this competition you need to predict for every given image number of pedestrians, number of people wearing masks in a correct way, and number of people wearing mask in an incorrect way.</p>
<p>The metrics used is the MAE: mean absolute error.</p>
<p>Submission can be done in teams according to the project.</p>
<p>You also need to submit (to me) the following: a complete report in latex, well commented source commented, and evaluation on your test set. These are obligatory for the project to be accepted.</p>
<p>To do the evaluation the result must be submitted in a csv file with following columns: filename, pieton, masque, mal_mis. Values in csv file must be separated be a comma. </p>
