</ul>

----------------------
# Evaluation

<p>The evaluation pages describes how submissions will be scored and how students should format their submissions. </p>
<hr>
<p>The evaluation metric for this competition is <a href=""https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Root-mean-square_deviation"">RMS Error</a>.  The RMS Error is given by:</p>

<p>\[ \text{RMS Error} = \sqrt{\frac{\sum_{i=1}^{n}(\hat{y} - y)^2}{n}} \]</p>

<h3> Public Leaderboard is evaluated only on 50% of the test data, remaining 50% will be evaluated after the contest ends</h3>

<h2>Submission Format</h2>
<p> For every row in the test dataset, there should be two columns in the output.csv file: <strong> Id and target</strong>. Order of the results should be kept the same.</p>

