<p> B¨¤i t?p n¨¤y ???c ?¨¢nh gi¨¢ b?ng thang ?i?m F1 score. F1 score l¨¤ m?c ?¨¢nh gi¨¢ th?ng d?ng trong c¨¢c b¨¤i to¨¢n x? ly ng?n ng?, ???c t¨ªnh b?ng c¨¢ch g?p 2 gi¨¢ tr? precision v¨¤ recall. Precision l¨¤ t? l? true positive tr¨ºn t?ng predicted positives (tp + fp), g?i l¨¤  ""?? ??c hi?u"". Recall l¨¤ t? l? true positive tr¨ºn t?ng actual positives (tp+fn), g?i l¨¤ ""?? nh?y"".</p>
<p> F1 score ???c t¨ªnh b?ng:</p>
<p> F1 = 2*(p*r)/(p+r)</p>
<p>F1 score s? ?¨¢nh gi¨¢ ??ng ??u ?? quan tr?ng c?a c? hai m?c ?? precision v¨¤ recall. M?t k?t qu? t?t s? c¨® gi¨¢ tr? precision v¨¤ recall ??u cao, d?n ??n F1 score cao.</p>
<h2>Format file b¨¤i n?p</h2>
