4106,mipt-nlp-hw3-2021,"# Description

<p>This is the third homework for <a href=""https://github.com/king-menin/mipt-nlp2021"">NLP course</a></p>
<p>In this task you aim to solve TERRa task.</p>

<p>Good luck!</p>
----------------------
# Evaluation

<h3>Metrics</h3>
<p>The evaluation of TERRa task is a simple accuracy metrics.</p>

<h3>Submission Format</h3>
<p>Submission file should contain two columns: Id and Predicted. Predicted column should has encoded labels (<i>entailment</i> or <i>not_entailment</i>).</p>","# Dataset Description

<h3>Dataset</h3>

