The only difference being that the ""label"" field is missing. 
Your job is to guess what the label is with your models!",True,True
4254,i2a2-nlp-2021-sentiment-analysis,"# Description

<p>Ol¨¢</p>

<p>Bem-vindo a primeira competi??o da turma de NLP do I2A2</p>

<p>O objetivo dessa competi??o ¨¦ para que voc¨º possa explorar um conjunto de dados que contem informa??es sobre reviews de produtos de um website de e-commerce e utilize as t¨¦cnicas NLP que voc¨º aprendeu para criar um modelo capaz de predizer o rating dado pelo usu¨¢rio (1-5 estrelas) a partir do coment¨¢rio.</p>
----------------------
# Evaluation

<p>Submissions are evaluated on classification accuracy (the percent of labels that are predicted correctly) for every review. The sentiment labels are:</p>
<hr>
<p>1 - negative</p>
<p>2 - somewhat negative</p>
<p>3 - neutral</p>
<p>4 - somewhat positive</p>
<p>5 - positive:</p>
<hr>
<p>The file should contain a header and have the following format:</p>
<pre>id,rating<br>1,5<br>2,1<br>3,5<br>4,4<br>5,4<br>...<br></pre>","# Dataset Description

<p> The dataset contains more than 130k e-commerce customer reviews, collected from the Americanas.com website between January and May, 2018. It offers rich information about the reviewer profile, such as gender, age, and geographical location.</p>

<h2>File descriptions</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>train.csv</strong> - the training set</li>
<li><strong>test.csv</strong> - the test set</li>
<li><strong>sampleSubmission.csv</strong> - a sample submission file in the correct format</li>
</ul>
<h2>Data fields</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>id</strong> - the id of the review</li>
<li><strong>submission_date</strong> - date/time - review submission date (format YYYY-MM-DD hh:mm:ss)</li>
<li><strong>review_title</strong> - text - review title, introduces or summarizes the review content</li>
<li><strong>review_text</strong> - text - main text content of the review</li>
<li><strong>reviewer_birth</strong> - year - integer reviewer¡¯s birth year</li>
<li><strong>reviewer_gender</strong> - string - reviewer¡¯s gender (¡±F¡± for female; ¡±M¡± for male)</li>
<li><strong>reviewer_location</strong> - string - reviewer¡¯s Brazilian State, according to the delivery address</li>
<li><strong>reviewer_id</strong> - string - unique reviewer id</li>
<li><strong>product_id</strong> - integer - unique product id</li>
<li><strong>product_name</strong> - string - product name</li>
<li><strong>product_brand</strong> - string - product brand</li>
<li><strong>site_category_lv1</strong> - string - product category  (first level)</li>
<li><strong>site_category_lv2</strong> - string - product subcategory (second level)</li>
<li><strong>rating</strong> - integer - overall customer rating, from 1 to 5</li>
</ul>",True,True
