<li>imagenet_trn/ - the training set images</li>
<li>imagenet_val/ - the validation set images</li>
<li>imagenet_tst/ - the testing set images</li>
<li>imagenet_trn.csv - the training set labels</li>
<li>imagenet_val.csv - the validation set labels</li>
<li>random_submission.csv - a sample submission file in the correct format</li>
</ul>",True,True
