### Task Description
Image Classification: Street View House Numbers
Training data: 68257 images
Validation data: 5000 images
Testing data: 26032 images
Extra data: 531131 images

Please **DO NOT** use the testing data and other data, we will consider this as **CHEATING**.

### Evaluation metric: 
Categorization Accuracy

### Deadlines
Kaggle: 6/29 (Tue.) 07:59 in UTC+8 (No late submission!)
