Image category classification with CIFAR-100 dataset.

(Note: this is an individual basis assignment!)

## Task
Given a set of images and their label, please train your model to classify a test image into the label. The label is class id string (looks like a number) - {00, 01, ¡­, 09}. So, total of 100 classes.

The image size is 32 (width) by 32 (height) pixels in RGB (3) channels.

## Evaluation metric
Top-1 accuracy: Compare with the true label with the predicted label by your trained model.
----------------------
# Evaluation

## Evaluation metric

Top-1 accuracy: Compare with the true label with the predicted label by your trained model.","# Dataset Description

