4406,golfdetection,"# Description

## Description
BoolArt Golf Detection Challenge is a practical competition to practice object detection methods. 
Please feel free to use any methods that you want and get a good score. 

### Annotation
Dataset follows the YoLoV5 annotation format.

### Evaluation
The evaluation metric in this competition is mAP.","# Dataset Description

For each image in the test set, you must predict a list of boxes describing objects in the image. Each box is described as
`ImageID,PredictionString`

`ImageID, Label_1 Confidence_1 x_center_1 y_center_1 width_1 height_1  Label_2 Confidence_2 x_center_2 y_center_2 width_2 height_2`",True,True
4407,classify-leaves,"# Description

The task is predicting categories of leaf images. This dataset contains 176 categories, 18353 training images, 8800 test images. Each category has at least 50 images for training. The test set is split evenly into the public and private leaderboard.

The evaluation metric for this competition is [Classification Accuracy](https://www.kaggle.com/vipulgandhi/how-to-choose-right-metric-for-evaluating-ml-model). 

Good luck and have fun!","# Dataset Description

File descriptions:

- train.csv - the training set
- test.csv - the test set
- sample_submission.csv - a sample submission file in the correct format (the labels are randomly generated so the initial accuracy is roughly 1/176)
- images/ - the folder contains all images

Data fields

- image - the image path, such as `images/0.jpg` 
- label - the category name",True,True
