4419,uit-spring-2021-ds200l11-assignment-8,"# Description

<p>Welcome to UIT Spring 2021 DS200.L11 Assignment 8 competition. In this competition, you are given a dataset of movie ratings. From this dataset, you will build a recommendation system to predict the ratings of given users for given movies. Besides the ratings, you are also given data related to name, genres, and tags of each movies.</p>

<p>The dataset in this competition is a subset of the MovieLens dataset.</p>
<p>When you submit a prediction, a 50% subset of it will be evaluated against the true labels and you get a ""public score"" for some feedback. The final score will be evaluated on the other 50%.</p>

<p>Give it your best shot and have fun!?? ?? ??</p>
----------------------
# Evaluation

<p>The scoring metric is Root Mean Squared Error.</p>","# Dataset Description

<p>The test set is in <strong>test.csv</strong> file. Other files contain data that you can use to predict the rating of users for movies specified in the test set. Make sure to check the required format of the solution given in the file <strong>sampleSolutions.csv</strong>.</p>",True,True
