<li><strong>marriage status</strong> - marriage status of candidate</li>
<li><strong>position</strong> - work or office position of candidate</li>
<li><strong>housing</strong> - does candidate owns house</li>
<li><strong>default</strong> - default column</li>
<li><strong>balance</strong> - bank balance of candidate</li>
<li><strong>day</strong> - day on which candidate was contacted</li>
<li><strong>month</strong> - month on which candidate was contacted</li>
<li><strong>ROI</strong> - return on investment candidate earns</li>
<li><strong>duration</strong> - duration for which candidate was contacted</li>
<li><strong>campaign</strong> - campaign</li>
<li><strong>pdays</strong> - previous campaign day</li>
<li><strong>previous</strong> - previous campaign detail about candidate</li>
<li><strong>card_owned</strong> - type of card owned by candidate</li>
<li><strong>poutcome</strong> - previous outcome</li>
<li><strong>y</strong> - y is target variable, it specifies that candidate buys or rejects our offer</li>


</ul>",True,True
