SLICED is streaming on Twitch Tuesdays at 8:30PM ET for twelve weeks starting June 1st: https://www.twitch.tv/nickwan_datasci. 

## About SLICED Season 1, Episode 10 (Playoffs 2)

- **Date**: August 3 at 8:30PM on https://www.twitch.tv/nickwan_datasci
- **Contestants**: Jesse, Ethan, Julia, Josh
- **Winner**: TBD!
- **Audience winner**: TBD!

