<li><strong>EYB</strong>:  The year an improvement was built more recent than actual year built</li>
<li><strong>STORIES</strong>:  Number of stories in primary dwelling</li>
<li><strong>SALEDATE</strong>:  Date of most recent sale</li>
<li><strong>QUALIFIED</strong>:  An indicator to reflect if a sale is representative of market value (for example, if it is part of a multi-parcel sale)</li>
<li><strong>SALE_NUM</strong>:  Sale Number</li>
<li><strong>GBA</strong>:   Gross building area in square feet</li>
<li><strong>BLDG_NUM</strong>:  Building Number on Property</li>
<li><strong>STYLE</strong>:  Style</li>
<li><strong>STRUCT</strong>:   Structure</li>
<li><strong>GRADE</strong>:  Grade</li>
<li><strong>CNDTN</strong>:   Condition</li>
<li><strong>EXTWALL</strong>:  Exterior wall</li>
<li><strong>ROOF</strong>:  Roof type</li>
<li><strong>INTWALL</strong>:  Interior wall</li>
