4535,ai-110-1-hw1,"# Description

<h2>Task Description</h2>
<ul>
  <li>COVID-19 daily cases prediction</li>
  <li>Source: Delphi group @ CMU - A daily survey since April 2020 via
facebook.</li>
  <img src=""https://img.onl/50MbQz"" width=""300"" height=""50"" alt=""percentage"">
  <li>Training data: 2700 samples</li>
  <li>Testing data: 893 samples</li>
  <li>Evaluation metric: Root Mean Squared Error &lt; RMSE &gt;</li>
  <img src=""https://img.onl/jdgKIC"" width=""400"" height=""80"" alt=""RMSE"">
</ul>

<h2>Objectives</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Solve a regression problem with deep neural networks (DNN)</li>
  <li>Understand basic DNN training tips, e.g. hyper-parameter tuning, feature selection, regularization, ...</li>
  <li>Get familiar with PyTorch.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Deadlines</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Kaggle: 110/07/10 23:59:59 </li>
</ul>
<b>No late submission!<p></p>

<h2>Notes</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Team Name:  &lt; student ID &gt;_ &lt; anything &gt;£¨e.g. 1120530001_Daniel£©</li>
  <li>Compress your code and report into  &lt; student ID &gt; _hw1.zip;£¨e.g. 1120530001_hw1.zip£©</li>
  <li>Maximum Daily Submission: 5</li>
</ul>
</b>","# Dataset Description

<ul>
<li><strong>covid.train.csv</strong>> : Training data</li>
<li><strong>covid.test.csv</strong> : Testing data</li>
<li><strong>sampleSubmission.csv</strong> :  a sample submission file in the correct format</li>
</ul>

<h2>Description</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Given survey results in the <b>past 3 days</b> in a specific <b>state</b> in U.S., then
predict the percentage of <b>new tested positive cases</b> in the 3rd day.</li>
  <img src=""https://img.onl/Lw3uJ3"" width=""600"" height=""100"" alt=""Day3"">
</ul>

<h2>Data - Columns (Features) - Percentage%</h2>
