The only prerequisites you need are [NodeJS v12](https://nodejs.org/en/download/) or above installed and any tooling for your programming language of choice. The Lux AI team offers technical support for Python, Typescript/Javascript, C++, and Java for this competition. More languages are TBD.

All instructions in addition to the starter kits you need to start writing a bot and submit them to the competition are in https://github.com/Lux-AI-Challenge/Lux-Design-2021.

