----------------------
# Evaluation

<p></p>
<hr>
<p>We use AUC ROC evaluation metric <a href=''https://www.kaggle.com/biphili/roc-auc-classification-model-evaluation?scriptVersionId=53311716"">Click here to know about AUC ROC</a></p>
<h2>Submission Format</h2>
<p><strong>For every object in the dataset</strong>, submission files should contain two columns: ID and Status. Status should be either 1 or 0 depending on whether an object is legendary or not.</p>
<p>The file should contain a header and have the following format:</p>
<pre>ID,Status<br><br></pre>","# Dataset Description

