3. Click ""add your token"" and paste 0xc783bdc053696bcbd79dfbbc954f0100fb2dfed7.
3. Private message chengyang your account ID for CiV. :)","# Dataset Description

<p>You're given training.csv containing ~730000 data points, each representing a CiVilium exchange. You should use the time(Unix_Timestamp) and volume of an exchange (Volume_CiVilium) to predict the price of Civilium at that time. </p>

<p>Use the model you developed to predict the prices</p>
